<main class="resource-site" lang="en"><div class="claim-alert"><div class="site-shell"><span>Questions about an existing Majestic roof?</span><a href="tel:+19808005991">(980) 800-5991</a></div></div><header class="claim-header"><div class="site-shell"><a href="/" class="brand"><span class="brand-mark" aria-hidden="true"><i></i><i></i><i></i></span><span><strong>MAJESTIC</strong><small>ROOFING, INC.</small></span></a><nav><a href="/">Home</a><a href="#eligibility">Eligibility</a><a href="#transfer-form">Request</a></nav><a href="/es/transferencia-de-garantia-de-techo" class="language-toggle language-link">ESPAÑOL</a></div></header><section class="resource-hero warranty-hero"><div class="site-shell"><p class="eyebrow eyebrow-light">10-year workmanship warranty</p><h1>Request a Majestic roof warranty transfer review.</h1><p>A sale does not automatically transfer every warranty. Send the property and project information so Majestic can verify the original agreement, roof condition and applicable manufacturer terms.</p></div></section><section class="resource-body section" id="eligibility"><div class="site-shell"><div class="section-heading split-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">Review before approval</p><h2>What Majestic verifies.</h2></div><p>Transfer eligibility is controlled by the signed workmanship warranty and the selected manufacturer’s written terms—not by this webpage.</p></div><div class="credential-grid"><article><strong>01</strong><span>Original Majestic contract, invoice and warranty record</span></article><article><strong>02</strong><span>Property ownership, closing date and transfer deadline</span></article><article><strong>03</strong><span>Roof condition, maintenance history and applicable exclusions</span></article></div></div></section><section class="claim-form-section section" id="transfer-form"><div class="site-shell claim-form-layout"><div><p class="eyebrow eyebrow-light">Transfer review request</p><h2>Start with the property record.</h2><p>Submitting this form does not approve or guarantee a transfer. Majestic will confirm eligibility and any inspection or document requirements in writing.</p></div><form class="claim-form"><div class="claim-form-heading"><p>WARRANTY TRANSFER</p><h2>Property details</h2><span>Fields marked required must be completed.</span></div><div class="claim-form-grid"><label><span>Current owner name</span><input required="" name="Current owner"/></label><label><span>New owner name</span><input required="" name="New owner"/></label><label class="wide"><span>Property address</span><input required="" name="Property address"/></label><label><span>Email</span><input required="" type="email" name="Email"/></label><label><span>Phone</span><input required="" type="tel" name="Phone"/></label><label><span>Closing date</span><input type="date" name="Closing date"/></label><label><span>Installation year</span><input inputMode="numeric" name="Installation year"/></label><label class="wide"><span>Invoice or warranty number (if known)</span><input name="Warranty number"/></label><label class="wide"><span>Notes</span><textarea rows="4" name="Notes"></textarea></label></div><label class="claim-consent"><input required="" type="checkbox" name="Consent" value="Yes"/><span>I authorize Majestic to contact me about this property and understand that this is a review request, not an approved transfer.</span></label><button class="button button-gold full-button" type="submit">Prepare email request →</button><p class="form-note"></p></form></div></section><footer class="claim-footer"><div class="site-shell"><a href="/" class="brand brand-footer"><span class="brand-mark" aria-hidden="true"><i></i><i></i><i></i></span><span><strong>MAJESTIC</strong><small>ROOFING, INC.</small></span></a><p>Written eligibility confirmation is required before any transfer is effective.</p><a href="tel:+19808005991">(980) 800-5991</a></div></footer></main>
